{"route":"/docs/4.5/components/progress/","version":"4.5","renderedVersion":"4.5","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Progress","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.5.3/site/docs/4.5/components/progress.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for using Bootstrap custom progress bars featuring support for stacked bars, animated backgrounds, and text labels."},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Progress components are built with two HTML elements, some CSS to set the width, and a few attributes. We don’t use <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/progress\">the HTML5 <code>&lt;progress&gt;</code> element</a>, ensuring you can stack progress bars, animate them, and place text labels over them."},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"We use the <code>.progress</code> as a wrapper to indicate the max value of the progress bar."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"We use the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> to indicate the progress so far."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> requires an inline style, utility class, or custom CSS to set their width."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> also requires some <code>role</code> and <code>aria</code> attributes to make it accessible."}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Put that all together, and you have the following examples."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-1","type":"demo","key":"151ff1a15cd779c90dad","height":300},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap provides a handful of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/sizing/\">utilities for setting width</a>. Depending on your needs, these may help with quickly configuring progress."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-2","type":"demo","key":"d9b0e03dd590a04ad623","height":147},{"id":"how-it-works--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"labels","type":"heading","en":"Labels","level":2},{"id":"labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add labels to your progress bars by placing text within the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"labels--example-1","type":"demo","key":"eb5edf3551569527fcd5","height":147},{"id":"labels--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">25%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"height","type":"heading","en":"Height","level":2},{"id":"height--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"We only set a <code>height</code> value on the <code>.progress</code>, so if you change that value the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> will automatically resize accordingly."},{"id":"height--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b4b047f8475b8df07430","height":174},{"id":"height--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 1px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 20px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"backgrounds","type":"heading","en":"Backgrounds","level":2},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use background utility classes to change the appearance of individual progress bars."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b3334221ee276e09d758","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"multiple-bars","type":"heading","en":"Multiple bars","level":2},{"id":"multiple-bars--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Include multiple progress bars in a progress component if you need."},{"id":"multiple-bars--example-1","type":"demo","key":"45bd45ca9dd68820c3d0","height":147},{"id":"multiple-bars--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 15%\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 30%\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 20%\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"striped","type":"heading","en":"Striped","level":2},{"id":"striped--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.progress-bar-striped</code> to any <code>.progress-bar</code> to apply a stripe via CSS gradient over the progress bar’s background color."},{"id":"striped--example-1","type":"demo","key":"faeb388db550ea452d1c","height":300},{"id":"striped--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 10%\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"animated-stripes","type":"heading","en":"Animated stripes","level":2},{"id":"animated-stripes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The striped gradient can also be animated. Add <code>.progress-bar-animated</code> to <code>.progress-bar</code> to animate the stripes right to left via CSS3 animations."},{"id":"animated-stripes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"4114a0f9ced28f57cbbb","height":174},{"id":"animated-stripes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"151ff1a15cd779c90dad","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d9b0e03dd590a04ad623","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"eb5edf3551569527fcd5","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">25%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b4b047f8475b8df07430","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 1px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 20px;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%;\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b3334221ee276e09d758","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"45bd45ca9dd68820c3d0","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 15%\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 30%\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 20%\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"faeb388db550ea452d1c","html":"\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 10%\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 25%\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 50%\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 75%\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 100%\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"4114a0f9ced28f57cbbb","html":"\n  <div class=\"progress\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary bd-toggle-animated-progress\" data-toggle=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n    Toggle animation\n  </button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/int